{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_045_02_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:00fc334c2f677ca87504f83b3bfa2f65d4e44806b0dc7e1a14e4f92d46f2757d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:531b71ebf9714fea0c740484db96a9a728a3d7e2f32960e0ecdb4578758c826a",
      "text": "（在彼此的生日发发信息、\n准备礼物聚在一起……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b45242e91b22e65c5c7a9d66e4011ec01af69a2cca17464a7f4dea527a62ef9c",
      "text": "（不知不觉间都快变成例行公事了呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6acef36068646c7ba8848b948a327bef31daa1449da58376ecf120769a06a4de",
      "text": "（虽然被庆祝很开心，\n但果然还是有点不太习惯呢～……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a9c634c5f1bdf6e5275972c1b86fd5072e40af29b63a2e03acaada1ffcb118f",
      "text": "（嘛，给雨彦先生和克里斯先生庆祝的时候，\n感觉也挺不可思议的就是了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08d8e84a0772c9c9023a6fee4769432e5bbe24f00ea8954b3ead4d67d246ec74",
      "text": "（我会这么想，也是理所当然的吧～。\n虽然绝对不会对他们本人说就是了～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fb8230e378fd383831e2696c5e8e16d9208b41046af7a11faf6538068a07e1e",
      "text": "（与人相处，舒适距离难拿捏。……看来要\n长期交往下去了，还是得适度配合一下呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f1d91783088178a7202d3e966b6ba0f51042c9e2eca2e13c249e794de965aaf",
      "text": "既然没停课，应该能按原定计划到达吧～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ebe6e6d59419cd668cc37738a558b120c1d3ceee994509038d43479336f442d",
      "text": "（“应该会在昨天说的时间到事务所～”）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:282491b286f54fd27a1f89b472a7d5df30ed1048cc1697a5bea0f1929eba6da5",
      "text": "（……这样就好了。\n差不多该去大学了～）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
